## Breaking Changes

### Streaming
- None (additive only)

### Permissions
- `Agent.visibility` deprecated in favor of `permissionOverrides.canSee.agents`
- Still supported for backwards compatibility

### Federation
- `FederationRouteRequestParams.message` deprecated in favor of `envelope`
- Old format supported temporarily for migration

